WEBVTT

1
00:00.380 --> 00:05.220
But it felt really, really, really good.

2
00:05.220 --> 00:13.880
It was just this sort of, like… oh, what is this?

3
00:13.880 --> 00:15.880
Like, what is going on?

4
00:15.880 --> 00:18.720
And all of a sudden I’m like, oh wow, this feels really good.

5
00:18.720 --> 00:23.440
But it just sort of snuck up on me.

6
00:23.440 --> 00:26.800
And it was this very vertical feeling, like a stretching,

7
00:26.800 --> 00:29.380
really quickly and with no end in sight.

8
00:31.440 --> 00:35.200
At first, for I don’t know how long, I was just rocketing upward.

9
00:35.200 --> 00:40.620
To the point where I initially was like, what is this?

10
00:40.620 --> 00:42.520
And then I was like, wow, this feels really good.

11
00:42.520 --> 00:47.480
And then, kind of without me noticing, I started plummeting down.

12
00:47.480 --> 00:53.220
But again, a free-fall, enjoyable, woohoo rollercoaster thing.

13
00:54.340 --> 00:58.020
Minus the emotional connotations of a rollercoaster, right?

14
00:58.060 --> 00:58.780
It was all good.

15
00:58.780 --> 01:08.220
In terms of intensity, uniqueness, meaningfulness… an order of magnitude

16
01:08.220 --> 01:12.800
more than anything I’ve experienced in the past week, month or year.

